                    <a name="#don1">What are donation types?</a><!--End-->
                    <h1>Support Options</h1>
                    <p>The AG platform is entirely owned and operated by its members. As an agriculture co-operative all donations are allocated to the finance committee.</p>
                    <p>Donations are not investments and should not be mistaken for an investment in the AG Platform.</p>
                    <p>There are only two paths that a donation can be giving; Avatar Development or Administration of the platform.</p>
                    <!-- ####################################################################################################### -->
                    <a name="#don2">How do I track my donations?</a><!--End-->
                    <h1>Track Donations</h1>
                    <p>Donors will always have the ability to track all of their donations to AG.</p>
                    <p>In our effort to stay a leader in all that we do our goal is to create the most transparant platform to date.</p>
